    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always felt a distance from mathematics, even though I studied it in school. It never sparked my curiosity like philosophy or literature did. I find it structured and logical, but it doesn’t resonate with me the way stories or human experiences do. I enjoy the patterns, but I don’t feel a deep connection to it.",
